---
import '../styles/reset.css';
import '../styles/global.css';

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Link from '../components/Link.astro';
import Projects from '../components/Projects.astro';
---

<Layout title="Tyler Nguyen" description="Tyler Nguyen's personal website.">
	<div class="introduction">
		<section>
			<h2>About</h2>
			<p>I'm Tyler Nguyen (he/him), a freshman at Georgia Tech, majoring in Computer Science. I have interests in web development and design, graphic design, typography, music, and film.</p>
			<p>I was introduced to music and instruments at an early age, learning piano at about six and taking up the violin during middle school. During my sophomore year at FCS Innovation Academy, I decided to start learning guitar, partly because my father also played and also because I had started gaining an interest in music production and recording. As of now, I have released 2 full-length albums, 2 EPs, and 2 singles onto streaming platforms.</p>
			<p>As for my interests in design and web development, it began during the COVID lockdown when I decided to learn HTML and CSS. During this time, I would begin to involve myself more within the concepts of web design and the process of creating websites. This accelerated during my freshman year, and I would take an interest in other related topics like design and more specifically typography.</p>
		</section>
		<div>
			<section>
				<h2>Where To Find Me</h2>
				<p><Link link="mailto:tnguyen3037@gmail.com">Email</Link></p>
				<p><Link link="https://github.com/nguyentylern">GitHub</Link></p>
			</section>
			<section>
				<h2>Resume</h2>
				<p><Link link="/documents/resume.pdf">Resume</Link></p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</div>
	<section class="projects">
		<div class="projects-text">
			<h2>Projects</h2>
			<p>Here are some projects I have worked on. Many are related to school (though the skills required were developed by myself), but some are independent of my academics. This section will be updated.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="projects-list">
			<Projects></Projects>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.introduction {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: var(--spacer1);
	}
	.introduction > div > * + * {
		margin-top: var(--spacer2);
	}
	section > * + * {
		margin-top: var(--spacer1);
	}
	section > p {
		text-align: justify;
	}
	.projects {
		margin-top: var(--spacer2);
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: var(--spacer1);
	}
	.projects-text > * + * {
		margin-top: var(--spacer1);
	}
	.projects-text p {
		text-align: justify;
	}
	.projects-list {
		grid-column: span 2;
	}
	@media (width < 44rem) {
		.introduction, .projects {
			display: block;
		}
		.introduction > div {
			margin-top: var(--spacer2);
		}
	}
</style>
